// types/
// This directory will contain all shared TypeScript type definitions and interfaces
// used across the frontend application.
// Examples:
//   - User, Student, Teacher, Class, Grade, Attendance, Announcement interfaces
//   - API response wrapper types (PaginatedResponse<T>, ApiError)
//   - Form input types aligned with Zod schemas
//   - Enums: UserRole, AttendanceStatus, GradeScale
